      "contents": "Surface unit on its 60 mm pole with the seabed footing plate, the float-collar variant, the listening head on its sensor line, three mussel longlines with barrel buoys and droppers, seabed, a school of nine gilthead seabream, a 5.2 m work boat for scale, and a water surface.",
